  "content_html": "<h1>a poem divided into 4 parts</h1>\n<p>2025</p>\n<p>abstract poem on 4 sets of layered tracing paper</p>\n<figure class=\"docsViewerFigure docsViewerFigure--full-column\" data-docs-content-detail=\"media\" data-docs-media-kind=\"catalogue-work\" data-docs-media-id=\"00001\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"docsViewer__mediaImageLink docsViewerFigure__imageLink\" data-docs-media-open aria-label=\"Open a poem divided into 4 parts (&quot;our dreams are real&quot;) in Media View\"><img data-docs-media-image alt=\"a poem divided into 4 parts (&quot;our dreams are real&quot;)\" hidden title=\"a poem divided into 4 parts (&quot;our dreams are real&quot;)\"><span data-docs-media-placeholder>a poem divided into 4 parts (&quot;our dreams are real&quot;)</span></button><figcaption><span class=\"docsViewerFigure__caption\">a poem divided into 4 parts (&quot;our dreams are real&quot;)</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p>written on both sides</p>\n<p>17 numbered sheets, marks or words made on each side - collectively they are the poem.\n4 parts constructed by selecting sheets and which side to face upward at random\nand layered together in 4 sets</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.dotlineform.com/docs/analysis/sub-scopes/works/media/img/d-20260801-212422-d91151-image-02.webp\" alt=\"d 20260801 212422 d91151 image 02\" title=\"d 20260801 212422 d91151 image 02\" /></p>\n"
